<h1>Reactor Demos</h1>

<h2>Form Interrupt Demo</h2>
<p>This demo starts a reactor, which pauses to ask for user input (Bio), and then resumes.</p>
<%= form_with url: reactors_path, method: :post, local: true do |f| %>
  <%= f.label :user_name, "Enter your name:" %>
  <%= f.text_field :user_name %>
  <%= f.submit "Start Application" %>
<% end %>

<hr>

<h2>Webhook Interrupt Demo</h2>
<p>To test webhook interrupt:</p>
<pre>
# In rails console:
r = WebhookInterruptReactor.run(provider_id: 123)
puts r.context.result(:initiate_request) # => "req_123_xxxx"

# Then curl:
curl -X POST http://localhost:3000/webhooks/receive \
  -d "request_id=REQ_ID_FROM_ABOVE" \
  -d "status=approved"
</pre>
